(FirstCut 2027 - Take 13 Official Submission Guidelines) Tj T*
(Organized by FLAME University, Pune) Tj T*
(------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(ABOUT FIRSTCUT) Tj T*
(Welcome to FirstCut, one of India's premier international student film) Tj T*
(festivals, organized by FLAME University, Pune. FirstCut provides a dynamic) Tj T*
(platform for young filmmakers across the globe, encouraging them to explore) Tj T*
(film as a medium of growth and change. In 2026, FirstCut Take 12 received) Tj T*
(700+ submissions from students representing 75+ countries.) Tj T*
(At the final event, shortlisted films will be screened for a live audience) Tj T*
(and evaluated by a distinguished jury from the Indian film industry. The) Tj T*
(screenings will be followed by engaging panel discussions and talks with) Tj T*
(renowned film personalities.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(AWARDS & PRIZES) Tj T*
(- Winners in each category receive a certificate and INR 30,000 cash prize.) Tj T*
(- Transaction charges will apply to international winners.) Tj T*
(- Submissions to FirstCut are FREE of charge.) Tj T*
(- Attending the event is FREE and open to all.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(KEY DATES FOR TAKE 13) Tj T*
(- Opening Date: Tentative: 21 Oct 2026) Tj T*
(- Final Deadline: 10 Jan 2027) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY & CATEGORY TIME LIMITS) Tj T*
(- Multiple Submissions: Students can submit multiple films across categories.) Tj T*
(- Student ID: Submission of VALID STUDENT IDs IS MANDATORY at submission.) Tj T*
(- Fiction: Max 20 minutes) Tj T*
(- Non-Fiction: Max 40 minutes) Tj T*
(- Animation: Max 10 minutes) Tj T*
(- Nano: Max 2 minutes) Tj T*
(- Crew Eligibility: Directors, cinematographers, editors, scriptwriters,) Tj T*
(  and sound designers must be current undergraduate or master's students) Tj T*
(  or recent graduates \(graduated within 2026\). Actors and other crew) Tj T*
(  members do not need to be students. No limit per institution.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PRODUCTION GUIDELINES & COMPLETION DATES) Tj T*
(- Films must be original \(music, visuals, scripts\). No copyrighted material.) Tj T*
(- Projection-quality picture and sound are preferred.) Tj T*
(- All films, including those in English, MUST have English subtitles.) Tj T*
(- Content must adhere to legal standards \(no obscenity, defamation,) Tj T*
(  copyright infringement, or incitement of communal disharmony\).) Tj T*
(- Completion Dates: Fiction, Non-Fiction, and Nano films must be completed) Tj T*
(  on or after January 30, 2026. Animation films on or after January 30, 2025.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SUBMISSION GUIDELINES) Tj T*
(- Submit via FirstCut's website or FilmFreeway. Submit on 1 platform only.) Tj T*
(- Films must be submitted as downloadable links via Google Drive, Vimeo,) Tj T*
(  or Hidden YouTube.) Tj T*
